# Coverflow Carousel — horizontal paging FlatList of 11 remote photos; each card's
# width, scaleY, translateX, borderRadius and opacity are interpolated from the
# scroll offset (7-point ranges, scaleY/translateX/borderRadius unclamped).
# What this test covers: one-card drags in both directions, a drag shorter
# than half a card (snaps back), flinging all the way to the last card and
# over-scrolling past it, flinging back to the first and over-scrolling the
# start (offset < 0: extrapolated scaleY/translateX on the first cards),
# reversing direction mid-momentum, and a tap on the centred card.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/coverflow-carousel"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
wait 2500
gesture pan 280 437 -160 0 600
wait 900
gesture pan 280 437 -160 0 600
wait 900
gesture pan 120 437 160 0 600
wait 900
# Short drag: snaps back.
gesture pan 250 437 -50 0 600
wait 900
# Fling to the end and past it.
gesture fling left 300 437 250
wait 700
gesture fling left 300 437 250
wait 700
gesture fling left 300 437 250
wait 700
gesture fling left 300 437 250
wait 700
gesture fling left 300 437 250
wait 1000
gesture pan 350 437 -300 0 700
wait 1200
# Reverse mid-momentum.
gesture fling right 100 437 250
wait 150
gesture fling left 300 437 250
wait 1200
# Back to the start and past it.
gesture fling right 100 437 250
wait 700
gesture fling right 100 437 250
wait 700
gesture fling right 100 437 250
wait 700
gesture fling right 100 437 250
wait 700
gesture fling right 100 437 250
wait 700
gesture fling right 100 437 250
wait 1000
gesture pan 50 437 300 0 700
wait 1200
press 201 437
wait 800
wait "label=\"Close\"" 3000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\" id=\"xmark\""
wait 1500
